 "summary": "Radwag's PUE C32, HX7 and HX5.EX indicators act as Modbus slaves over RS-232, RS-485 (not on the C32) or Ethernet. Input registers give mass, tare, unit, status and thresholds per platform; holding registers take zero/tare/print commands and parameter writes such as a tare value, thresholds, outputs and product codes.",
